  "body": "•First Time on the Market in 20 Years\r\n•Spacious Family Home + Study\r\n•Solid Brick & Block Construction\r\n•Large Swimming Pool & Private, Fully Fenced Backyard\r\n•Garage + Ample Off-Street Parking\r\n•Elevated Cul-de-Sac Position Close to Waiake Beach\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet, elevated cul-de-sac, 2/3 Bronwyn Place is being offered to the market for the first time in 20 years, presenting a fantastic opportunity to secure a much-loved family home in a sought-after Torbay location.\r\n\r\nBuilt in solid brick and block, the home offers generous proportions with four bedrooms, two bathrooms, a dedicated study and comfortable living spaces, giving families plenty of room to spread out. Partial double glazing, along with ceiling and wall insulation, adds to the year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nOutside is where this home really comes into its own. The large swimming pool and generous deck are made for summer, with a private, fully fenced backyard and landscaped gardens providing plenty of space for entertaining, children and pets.\r\n\r\nA garage and ample off-street parking add everyday practicality, with public transport options also close by.\r\n\r\nJust a short distance from Waiake Beach, Torbay shops and local amenities, the home is also zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College – a great location for families at every stage.\r\n\r\nCherished by the current owners for 20 years, this is a home that has been genuinely enjoyed and is now ready for its next owners.\r\n\r\nTo be sold by way of Auction (unless sold prior), 1.30pm, Thursday 29th October, Bayleys Corner 2 - 8 Northcroft Street, Takapuna, Auckland\r\n                              \r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing, or we look forward to welcoming you at our open homes.",
